WEBVTT

00:00:05.290 --> 00:00:07.650
That's a wrap on today's classes.

00:00:08.210 --> 00:00:10.040
Come on! It's time for work!

00:00:10.040 --> 00:00:11.490
You switched gears fast!

00:00:11.490 --> 00:00:16.740
Listen Chiya, I really appreciate you
stepping up to help Rabbit House in my place.

00:00:17.170 --> 00:00:20.240
Don't mention it. You have your hands full
with the roasted chestnut stall, right?

00:00:20.580 --> 00:00:21.400
Yeah.

00:00:21.400 --> 00:00:24.920
My Santa getup is really popular
with the customers and their kids!

00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:30.420
Besides, I never imagined that Rabbit House
would become such a hot spot.

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:33.260
No worries, I'll look after Chino!

00:00:33.580 --> 00:00:35.500
Great! Thanks a lot!

00:00:36.630 --> 00:00:40.390
Just leave the role of 
big sister to me for now!

00:00:40.390 --> 00:00:42.460
Yahoo!

00:00:42.460 --> 00:00:43.960
Why is she so hyper?!

00:00:44.750 --> 00:00:47.310
Wait for me, my sweet sister!

00:00:47.310 --> 00:00:50.270
My big sister sense is tingling! This is bad!

00:00:50.270 --> 00:00:52.630
Hold on, Chiya!

00:00:56.330 --> 00:00:59.960
Kuruntto hitomawari hora dance dance

00:00:59.960 --> 00:01:03.240
Tenkuu cafeteria de dance dance

00:01:03.240 --> 00:01:05.790
Door wa doko? (Kocchi!)

00:01:05.790 --> 00:01:09.540
Cup no naka e pyon (Tobikonjatte!)

00:01:09.540 --> 00:01:12.690
Osora ni ukabeta mokomoko na kumo

00:01:12.690 --> 00:01:15.920
Jitsu wa ne amai no honto ni (uso desu!)

00:01:15.920 --> 00:01:19.080
Osora ni tea cup to coffee cup tonjaeba

00:01:19.080 --> 00:01:21.710
Dokodemo ikemasu ne isshoni

00:01:22.330 --> 00:01:28.270
Itsumademo yume miteitaitte 
(Arieru koto yori arienai koto)

00:01:28.270 --> 00:01:34.300
Kangaete ashita ni tokimeite 
(Shiritai aji ga ippai desu)

00:01:34.300 --> 00:01:36.820
Sugar yori cinnamon ga

00:01:36.820 --> 00:01:40.840
Ki ni nari dashitara shinka no toki kamo

00:01:40.840 --> 00:01:44.210
Atarashii basho ni (Yobareta?)

00:01:44.210 --> 00:01:47.250
Yobaretara omoikitte tobimashou

00:01:47.250 --> 00:01:50.250
(Notte notte tea cup de gungun sora tobeba)

00:01:50.250 --> 00:01:52.460
(Notte notte coffee cup hai hai)

00:01:52.460 --> 00:01:56.210
Kuruntto hitomawari hora 
dance dance (Dance dance!)

00:01:56.210 --> 00:01:59.460
Tenkuu cafeteria de dance 
dance (Dance dance!)

00:01:59.460 --> 00:02:03.190
Door wa doko? Cup no naka desu

00:02:03.190 --> 00:02:05.710
Mousou? Genjitsu? Docchi?

00:02:05.710 --> 00:02:08.750
Docchidemo iinjanai kana (sokka)

00:02:08.750 --> 00:02:12.080
Atama ni whip sarechatte (Fuwa fuwa)

00:02:12.080 --> 00:02:18.000
Saa odottara (Mirai wa) kitto 
tanoshii kara (tonjaimasuka!)

00:02:18.240 --> 00:02:21.250
Osora ni tea cup to coffee cup tonjatte

00:02:21.250 --> 00:02:24.330
Dokodemo ikemasu ne isshoni!

00:02:25.000 --> 00:02:29.000
Bunnisode 11:
The Cafe of Smiles and the Rainbow Magician

00:02:33.330 --> 00:02:34.500
Hey, Senpai!

00:02:35.500 --> 00:02:37.830
Are you headed for the theater 
club to help them out?

00:02:38.210 --> 00:02:38.960
Yep.

00:02:39.330 --> 00:02:42.390
Sorry to ask you to fill 
in for me at work, Syaro.

00:02:42.750 --> 00:02:45.630
No problem. I'm actually 
pretty excited about it!

00:02:46.670 --> 00:02:49.170
I'll keep an eye on Chino for you!

00:02:49.880 --> 00:02:52.950
And I'll make things at Rabbit House
just as lively as they usually are!

00:02:52.950 --> 00:02:54.330
Catch you later!

00:02:54.330 --> 00:02:56.000
Uh, okay, thanks.

00:02:58.540 --> 00:02:59.710
That's weird.

00:03:00.330 --> 00:03:02.420
I suddenly feel... a little sad.

00:03:09.080 --> 00:03:10.960
It was worth the trip!

00:03:10.960 --> 00:03:13.330
It's so cute!

00:03:13.750 --> 00:03:15.750
Look at that! It's so cute!
This is that cafe from the magazine!

00:03:16.130 --> 00:03:17.460
I'm gonna snap a pic!

00:03:19.000 --> 00:03:20.670
Their little rabbit sign is super adorable!

00:03:20.670 --> 00:03:22.050
It's delicious!

00:03:22.050 --> 00:03:22.750
Delicious!

00:03:22.750 --> 00:03:25.710
Chiya and Syaro are here to help out today.

00:03:26.420 --> 00:03:29.040
But they haven't come out 
of the changing room yet...

00:03:29.710 --> 00:03:31.710
Did they not like the uniforms?

00:03:33.000 --> 00:03:34.670
You've got him on the wrong way!

00:03:35.330 --> 00:03:37.440
We don't want his butt getting 
in the customer's faces!

00:03:37.440 --> 00:03:39.940
Wh-what's the purpose of all this?

00:03:40.380 --> 00:03:43.460
We're going to make Chino 
happy by matching her style!

00:03:43.460 --> 00:03:45.450
More like throw a wet blanket on her!

00:03:47.790 --> 00:03:48.670
Hey, Chino!

00:03:50.000 --> 00:03:51.110
Sorry to keep you!

00:03:51.110 --> 00:03:53.330
H-how do we look?

00:03:54.170 --> 00:03:56.460
Y-you both look fabulous.

00:03:56.880 --> 00:03:58.130
That's great!

00:04:02.330 --> 00:04:04.430
Now we have even more mascot rabbits.

00:04:04.750 --> 00:04:06.830
It's so heartwarming to 
see them getting along.

00:04:07.420 --> 00:04:10.640
I'm still overwhelmed by 
how huge this tree is.

00:04:10.640 --> 00:04:13.420
It was a present from Rize's father.

00:04:15.170 --> 00:04:17.500
It's a little depressing 
without any ornaments on it.

00:04:17.500 --> 00:04:19.840
It arrived so suddenly,
we didn't have any time to prepare...

00:04:19.840 --> 00:04:20.880
Ornaments?!

00:04:22.080 --> 00:04:23.290
And that'll do it!

00:04:24.960 --> 00:04:28.040
I'm glad I thought ahead
and brought some promotional merch!

00:04:28.040 --> 00:04:29.450
This feels wrong.

00:04:30.420 --> 00:04:32.960
We're being invaded by Ama Usa...

00:04:34.080 --> 00:04:35.920
My poor cafe...

00:04:37.170 --> 00:04:38.210
Excuse me!

00:04:39.330 --> 00:04:40.750
Syaro, do you mind?

00:04:40.750 --> 00:04:43.510
The order for table 3, right? I've got it.

00:04:43.790 --> 00:04:45.170
You handle cleaning up table 2.

00:04:45.170 --> 00:04:46.300
Already on it.

00:04:46.300 --> 00:04:47.080
And don't forget...

00:04:47.080 --> 00:04:48.460
...to check the reservations. Yeah.

00:04:49.170 --> 00:04:52.770
So this is the power of the 
childhood friend duo, huh?

00:04:54.210 --> 00:04:55.520
There's no such thing!

00:04:54.750 --> 00:04:55.520
That's right!

00:04:56.130 --> 00:04:59.170
I can't tell if you two are 
actually in synch or not...

00:05:08.710 --> 00:05:10.530
Syaro really seems to be enjoying this.

00:05:11.080 --> 00:05:12.920
And she's not the only one.

00:05:13.250 --> 00:05:14.380
Chiya...

00:05:15.000 --> 00:05:20.040
Honestly, we both thought that wearing these uniforms
could only happen in our dreams.

00:05:21.250 --> 00:05:22.330
I see.

00:05:22.880 --> 00:05:25.790
But Syaro seems to have
a little too much spring in her step.

00:05:28.210 --> 00:05:33.000
You don't suppose... she's gotten drunk on caffeine
just from the smell of coffee?

00:05:33.460 --> 00:05:37.130
I'm not dwunk! Tra-la-la!

00:05:37.130 --> 00:05:38.750
She's definitely drunk...

00:05:41.040 --> 00:05:44.540
Behold, the Fleur-style 
herb tea floral waterfall!

00:05:44.540 --> 00:05:47.150
Wow! The puffs of steam 
look just like flowers!

00:05:47.150 --> 00:05:49.790
She's turned waitressing 
into a whole big show!

00:05:49.790 --> 00:05:51.210
I can't let her outdo me!

00:05:51.540 --> 00:05:53.750
Now it's catching on like wildfire!

00:05:54.210 --> 00:06:00.420
AMA

00:05:54.460 --> 00:05:57.460
A forbidden collaboration, 
sealed away by the ancients!

00:05:57.790 --> 00:06:00.170
Would you care for a 
coffee-anmitsu fusion drink?

00:06:00.420 --> 00:06:01.920
No! Stop!

00:06:01.920 --> 00:06:05.250
Our cafe is being taken over
by both Ama Usa An and Fleur!

00:06:05.250 --> 00:06:07.800
You've gotta stop them, Chino!

00:06:08.460 --> 00:06:11.840
We're currently offering free 
3D latte art with all orders!

00:06:11.840 --> 00:06:13.960
Christmas is turning into a nightmare...

00:06:15.290 --> 00:06:20.350
The Ama Usa x Fleur x Rabbit House
Spokesmodel Corps is hereby established!

00:06:20.350 --> 00:06:23.830
Our Spokesmodel Corps is 
the best in the business!

00:06:24.290 --> 00:06:27.380
Yet another new group has formed...

00:06:27.750 --> 00:06:29.330
A nightmare...

00:06:31.380 --> 00:06:33.210
Bye! Great work today!

00:06:33.670 --> 00:06:36.880
We can't make it tomorrow,
but we'll come to help again another time.

00:06:37.290 --> 00:06:40.750
We're leaving Anko and Wild Geese behind,
so make the best of them!

00:06:40.750 --> 00:06:42.380
What help are they gonna be?!

00:06:43.210 --> 00:06:45.130
Thank you so much.

00:06:45.670 --> 00:06:46.440
See you!

00:06:46.440 --> 00:06:47.710
Good night!

00:06:48.290 --> 00:06:49.590
U-um...

00:06:52.580 --> 00:06:54.830
Today was incredibly fun.

00:06:55.710 --> 00:06:58.170
If you two ever find yourselves in trouble...

00:06:59.330 --> 00:07:01.670
I'll definitely come back you up!

00:07:06.420 --> 00:07:08.630
Okay. Time to bring the sign inside.

00:07:09.710 --> 00:07:11.250
Looks like things turned out okay.

00:07:11.250 --> 00:07:12.240
Rize?!

00:07:12.240 --> 00:07:13.960
You were sneaking...

00:07:14.790 --> 00:07:15.920
Forget you saw me.

00:07:16.330 --> 00:07:19.420
So, what's your plan for the 
days those two can't come?

00:07:19.830 --> 00:07:22.880
My father and I can manage by ourselves!

00:07:22.880 --> 00:07:24.210
Actually...

00:07:25.170 --> 00:07:27.500
I called in some reinforcements of my own.

00:07:28.670 --> 00:07:29.710
Reinforcements?

00:07:31.000 --> 00:07:34.170
Don't tell me... they're 
men like your father...

00:07:34.890 --> 00:07:38.880
N-no thanks! Your reinforcements
will scare all the customers away!

00:07:38.880 --> 00:07:39.880
What she said.

00:07:39.880 --> 00:07:42.330
It's okay! That's not the kind
of reinforcements she meant!

00:07:42.670 --> 00:07:44.900
How long have you been hiding there?!

00:07:45.580 --> 00:07:48.380
Wait, then what kind of 
reinforcements are they?

00:07:48.880 --> 00:07:51.040
That'll be a surprise for later!

00:07:51.580 --> 00:07:52.150
Right?

00:07:52.150 --> 00:07:53.170
Yep!

00:07:53.830 --> 00:07:54.790
Okay...

00:07:55.380 --> 00:07:57.130
Everything good at the cafe?

00:07:57.500 --> 00:08:00.380
Were you able to coordinate 
well with Chiya and Syaro?

00:08:01.000 --> 00:08:02.330
Well...

00:08:03.960 --> 00:08:07.250
Somehow it felt like things went
even more swimmingly than usual!

00:08:07.250 --> 00:08:08.250
Say it ain't so!

00:08:08.920 --> 00:08:11.790
The three sisters of Rabbit House
are still number 1, right?!

00:08:12.290 --> 00:08:14.230
Hmmm, I'm not so sure.

00:08:14.230 --> 00:08:16.290
S-snap out of it, Chino!

00:08:24.960 --> 00:08:28.270
Nobody can make it to help today, right?

00:08:28.630 --> 00:08:30.250
Are you going to be okay, Chino?

00:08:30.630 --> 00:08:34.330
Dad will be helping me this 
afternoon. I'll be just fine.

00:08:30.920 --> 00:08:34.130
Wheat Flour

00:08:35.790 --> 00:08:40.500
Anko and Wild Geese are staying over,
so I don't feel lonely either.

00:08:40.920 --> 00:08:42.750
I want to snuggle with them soon!

00:08:46.960 --> 00:08:47.790
Huh?

00:08:48.290 --> 00:08:49.380
They're gone?!

00:08:50.790 --> 00:08:51.830
Where did they go...?

00:08:52.290 --> 00:08:54.000
We're over here, yo.

00:08:55.330 --> 00:08:57.880
Hook me up with the mornin' special, wud ya?

00:08:58.330 --> 00:08:59.960
I'll have the Japanese breakfast set!

00:09:00.630 --> 00:09:04.250
Th-th-the rice cooker hasn't finished yet!

00:09:04.250 --> 00:09:07.210
More importantly, when 
did you learn to speak?!

00:09:08.290 --> 00:09:10.210
Check out these uniforms!

00:09:10.210 --> 00:09:11.250
Cocoa and...

00:09:11.250 --> 00:09:13.820
...Rize made them for us!

00:09:14.420 --> 00:09:16.210
Maya?! Megu?!

00:09:17.330 --> 00:09:18.330
Why are you here?

00:09:18.790 --> 00:09:21.270
Well? Whaddya think? Surprised?

00:09:21.270 --> 00:09:23.830
We're here to be your 
reinforcements for the day!

00:09:24.210 --> 00:09:28.020
Hey. Isn't your uniform a 
little too similar to Chino's?

00:09:28.020 --> 00:09:29.710
No it's not!

00:09:29.710 --> 00:09:33.640
Chino's is cobalt blue! And mine is sky blue!

00:09:33.640 --> 00:09:36.460
Your outfit is the one copying 
Cocoa's with all the pink!

00:09:36.460 --> 00:09:38.540
But mine is salmon pink!

00:09:38.540 --> 00:09:41.130
Nah, it's chum pink! Chum pink!

00:09:41.130 --> 00:09:42.590
It's salmon!

00:09:42.590 --> 00:09:43.880
Right, Chino?

00:09:46.290 --> 00:09:48.040
Weird. She's frozen.

00:09:48.750 --> 00:09:50.120
What happened?

00:09:50.120 --> 00:09:51.290
Chino?

00:09:52.630 --> 00:09:54.110
She's crying?!

00:09:54.830 --> 00:09:56.450
I'm not crying!

00:09:56.450 --> 00:10:00.560
I didn't reach out to you for help because
I thought you were busy, so I'm just surprised...

00:10:00.560 --> 00:10:02.710
You're the busiest of us all, Chino!

00:10:02.710 --> 00:10:04.120
That's right!

00:10:04.380 --> 00:10:07.250
So, you prepared those 
uniforms just for today?

00:10:07.920 --> 00:10:09.920
Not exactly, we'll use them again next year!

00:10:09.920 --> 00:10:13.500
Because once we enter high school,
we can officially get part-time jobs!

00:10:18.210 --> 00:10:20.290
You made her cry, Maya!

00:10:20.750 --> 00:10:23.210
If those are tears of happiness, 
then you're just as guilty!

00:10:23.960 --> 00:10:25.770
Come now. Don't cry.

00:10:31.250 --> 00:10:32.580
There, there.

00:10:32.580 --> 00:10:33.960
Cheer up, Chino!

00:10:38.290 --> 00:10:40.750
A totally Japanese-style Christmas tree.

00:10:41.130 --> 00:10:43.130
The top is looking kind of bare.

00:10:43.460 --> 00:10:45.230
It needs a tree topper.

00:10:45.230 --> 00:10:48.080
We'll have to find something suitable.

00:10:48.080 --> 00:10:50.790
Wouldn't a star look best?

00:10:50.790 --> 00:10:52.290
Can we go buy one?

00:10:53.210 --> 00:10:54.040
Grandpa.

00:10:53.670 --> 00:10:55.080
What should we do?

00:10:55.830 --> 00:10:59.000
I've been saved by so many 
different people lately.

00:10:59.670 --> 00:11:03.290
I want to become an adult
who can return the favor someday.

00:11:03.830 --> 00:11:04.830
That would be nice.

00:11:04.830 --> 00:11:07.580
Our only option is to 
impale Tippy on the top!

00:11:07.580 --> 00:11:08.580
"Impale"?!

00:11:08.580 --> 00:11:10.000
Okay, let's do it!

00:11:10.000 --> 00:11:12.080
How did you decide on that?!

00:11:16.170 --> 00:11:18.250
G-go for it, Chino!

00:11:18.750 --> 00:11:21.750
This is the power of the Chimame Corps!

00:11:22.750 --> 00:11:24.580
Hi-yah!

00:11:26.540 --> 00:11:28.500
All right! We did it!

00:11:29.420 --> 00:11:33.290
A hand-made cotton Tippy
in place of a star! It's wonderful!

00:11:34.000 --> 00:11:36.250
Now it looks more like a Christmas tree.

00:11:36.750 --> 00:11:38.790
Chimame Corps for the win!

00:11:39.630 --> 00:11:41.460
Hooray!

00:11:49.830 --> 00:11:53.750
Merry Christmas! Welcome to Rabbit House!

00:11:53.750 --> 00:11:56.900
Those of you with a reservation, 
please come this way!

00:11:57.460 --> 00:12:00.210
Please check on tables 2, 3 and 6.

00:12:00.210 --> 00:12:01.960
I can't do that many at once!

00:12:02.790 --> 00:12:05.710
Chino, I need two Kilimanjaros for table 1.

00:12:06.250 --> 00:12:08.420
Uhhh...

00:12:08.420 --> 00:12:10.290
Her soul is halfway out the door!

00:12:10.880 --> 00:12:13.040
Hey, Chino! Get a hold of yourself!

00:12:13.040 --> 00:12:17.580
Hey! Heeeeeeeeey!

00:12:14.170 --> 00:12:17.290
Seeing everyone in our uniform
is like a dream come true...

00:12:17.580 --> 00:12:20.000
Is this Heaven?!

00:12:25.000 --> 00:12:29.500
Cocoa said she'd be back in time
for the party, but she's late.

00:12:30.960 --> 00:12:34.000
I wonder if the roasted chestnut stall
is super busy today?

00:12:35.420 --> 00:12:39.250
Santa has come to town! Ho, ho, ho!

00:12:39.250 --> 00:12:41.030
C-Cocoa?!

00:12:41.030 --> 00:12:46.330
Ho, ho, ho! Good boys and 
girls get roasted chestnuts!

00:12:45.290 --> 00:12:46.330
Yay!

00:12:46.330 --> 00:12:50.000
They're tasty! Ho, ho, ho!

00:12:46.710 --> 00:12:47.830
Santa!

00:12:49.290 --> 00:12:51.000
Wow! Thanks!

00:12:51.130 --> 00:12:54.540
She just came straight in 
her outfit from work...

00:12:54.540 --> 00:12:57.010
I bet she spent most of her 
earnings on those chestnuts.

00:12:57.010 --> 00:12:59.540
That seems likely. Very likely.

00:12:59.880 --> 00:13:01.540
Ho, ho, ho!

00:13:01.540 --> 00:13:04.080
I've got some for everyone, 
get 'em while they're hot!

00:13:04.080 --> 00:13:05.460
She's totally in character!

00:13:05.460 --> 00:13:06.680
Just kidding!

00:13:07.460 --> 00:13:08.650
Ta-dah!

00:13:08.650 --> 00:13:10.670
It was actually me, Cocoa!

00:13:11.920 --> 00:13:13.560
Everybody knew that.

00:13:26.540 --> 00:13:33.080
Cocoa, I was so shocked to learn that you and Rize
spent time completing those half-finished uniforms.

00:13:33.540 --> 00:13:35.210
It was a nice surprise, huh?

00:13:35.710 --> 00:13:37.830
Especially that Rize had a hand in it.

00:13:38.210 --> 00:13:40.040
I'm pretty decent with a needle, you know!

00:13:41.330 --> 00:13:42.340
But...

00:13:42.790 --> 00:13:48.630
Seeing all these colorful outfits in one place makes me
understand what Chino's mom wanted to accomplish.

00:13:49.380 --> 00:13:51.350
Huh? What did my mom want?

00:13:51.750 --> 00:13:52.850
All together now!

00:13:52.850 --> 00:13:55.330
Rabbit Rangers! Now in hoperation!

00:13:58.170 --> 00:13:59.710
H-hoperation?!

00:14:00.210 --> 00:14:02.170
What is happening to my cafe...?

00:14:14.460 --> 00:14:18.500
Okay! It's time to reveal who 
everybody's Secret Santa is!

00:14:19.000 --> 00:14:22.040
I'm so excited to find out! Who could it be?!

00:14:22.420 --> 00:14:23.750
Who do you think?

00:14:25.790 --> 00:14:26.760
C'mon, tell me guys!

00:14:27.830 --> 00:14:29.290
IT'S ME, DARN IT!

00:14:29.290 --> 00:14:31.800
Oh! So it was you, Syaro!

00:14:31.800 --> 00:14:33.260
Get off me!

00:14:34.000 --> 00:14:37.020
Oh my gosh! What a cute bank!

00:14:37.540 --> 00:14:40.250
I'll treasure it forever! I 
swear I won't smash it open!

00:14:41.830 --> 00:14:43.650
That's the face I wanted to see.

00:14:43.650 --> 00:14:46.880
Look, everybody! Check out what I got!

00:14:46.880 --> 00:14:48.460
Calm yourself down!

00:14:48.460 --> 00:14:49.410
Syaro.

00:14:49.410 --> 00:14:50.330
Yeah?

00:14:51.210 --> 00:14:54.410
Your Secret Santa... is me.

00:14:54.790 --> 00:14:57.540
Huh?! It was you, Senpai?!

00:15:00.290 --> 00:15:01.830
A sugar pot!

00:15:02.540 --> 00:15:05.250
I was hoping to get a gift 
that I knew you wanted,

00:15:05.250 --> 00:15:07.790
but I couldn’t stalk you to 
find out what that was, so…

00:15:08.130 --> 00:15:11.420
No, this is great! Thank you so much!

00:15:11.420 --> 00:15:12.540
And also...!

00:15:13.500 --> 00:15:16.720
You can totally stalk me any 
day of the week, Senpai!

00:15:16.720 --> 00:15:18.040
She's into it?!

00:15:19.250 --> 00:15:20.250
Here, Rize.

00:15:20.250 --> 00:15:22.210
This must mean you were my Santa!

00:15:23.000 --> 00:15:26.130
You've definitely got the gravitas
of a teacher now! Put it to good use!

00:15:26.130 --> 00:15:27.290
You look incredible!

00:15:27.290 --> 00:15:29.000
You're just making a big joke of this!

00:15:32.000 --> 00:15:34.630
A kimono sash clip! It's marvelous!

00:15:34.630 --> 00:15:37.790
It was so cute that I 
bought one of my own, too.

00:15:38.580 --> 00:15:40.290
Do you have a kimono to use it with?

00:15:41.420 --> 00:15:47.580
Well... I was hoping that maybe I could work
at Ama Usa next year and wear a kimono there.

00:15:48.170 --> 00:15:49.250
Oh, Megu...!

00:15:49.790 --> 00:15:51.130
That's news to me!

00:15:51.130 --> 00:15:53.080
Are you double-dealing on us?!

00:15:53.080 --> 00:15:56.000
I thought I was the one 
that you looked up to!

00:15:59.330 --> 00:16:02.830
Fine, then I'll go have my 
own fun by working at Fleur.

00:16:02.830 --> 00:16:04.460
Hold that thought!

00:16:05.500 --> 00:16:07.900
Your Secret Santa is none 
other than me, Maya!

00:16:07.900 --> 00:16:10.580
And I got you the newest game
on the market: Rabbit Chronicle!

00:16:10.580 --> 00:16:13.330
Forget what I just said, I'm 
totally working at Ama Usa!

00:16:13.330 --> 00:16:14.190
Aw, shucks.

00:16:14.190 --> 00:16:16.170
No fair, Chiya!

00:16:16.170 --> 00:16:17.170
How could you do this to me...?

00:16:17.170 --> 00:16:18.660
This game was on my wish list!

00:16:18.660 --> 00:16:19.630
Megu.

00:16:19.630 --> 00:16:20.670
Chino?

00:16:21.170 --> 00:16:24.540
I spent a lot of time thinking 
about what gift to get you.

00:16:24.880 --> 00:16:26.210
It's an aroma lamp.

00:16:27.330 --> 00:16:30.670
I would appreciate it if you'd consider
our cafe as your main place of business.

00:16:30.670 --> 00:16:31.880
With pleasure.

00:16:32.210 --> 00:16:35.550
Uh oh! Bribes are being handed 
out all over the place!

00:16:36.670 --> 00:16:38.470
I'm your Santa, Chino!

00:16:38.470 --> 00:16:42.060
It's a miniature chess 
set! Let's play sometime!

00:16:42.920 --> 00:16:44.380
Thank you very much.

00:16:44.830 --> 00:16:47.580
But wasn't this really expensive...?

00:16:48.080 --> 00:16:50.710
Actually, I had Megu help 
me out with the cost.

00:16:51.040 --> 00:16:53.330
We both owe you a debt 
of gratitude, after all.

00:16:54.920 --> 00:16:56.150
Not at all...

00:16:56.150 --> 00:16:58.420
If anyone, it's me who owes you.

00:16:59.130 --> 00:17:00.830
More than I could ever pay back...

00:17:01.540 --> 00:17:03.300
Okay, let's make a toast!

00:17:03.300 --> 00:17:04.830
T-toast?!

00:17:05.210 --> 00:17:07.460
C-cheers to all of you wonderful people!

00:17:07.830 --> 00:17:10.380
Oh! Chino took the initiative!

00:17:11.250 --> 00:17:13.340
Cheers, Chino!

00:17:13.670 --> 00:17:15.880
Cheers!

00:17:17.830 --> 00:17:21.100
Gather round, it's time to enjoy
this cake that Chino baked.

00:17:21.100 --> 00:17:22.500
Miss Rin?

00:17:22.500 --> 00:17:24.730
Why are you working here?

00:17:26.290 --> 00:17:31.620
The article that I wrote on this cafe caused
a lot of trouble for you after it was published,

00:17:31.620 --> 00:17:33.240
so I'm here to make amends.

00:17:33.240 --> 00:17:37.420
Gosh, no! We're actually overjoyed
to have so many new customers!

00:17:37.920 --> 00:17:39.080
Take a look over there!

00:17:40.250 --> 00:17:41.830
Miss Aoyama?!

00:17:42.330 --> 00:17:44.330
Ish so delishious.

00:17:44.960 --> 00:17:46.670
Having that much sass is 
something to be admired.

00:17:49.330 --> 00:17:51.630
Ladies & rabbits! Your attention please!

00:17:53.630 --> 00:17:55.210
Watch carefully now.

00:17:55.790 --> 00:17:57.710
One, two...

00:17:58.260 --> 00:17:59.140
three!

00:18:06.420 --> 00:18:08.130
Cocoa Santa is here to deliver...

00:18:09.710 --> 00:18:12.670
special Christmas presents for you all!

00:18:15.750 --> 00:18:17.140
For everyone?

00:18:17.140 --> 00:18:18.500
Cocoa!

00:18:18.500 --> 00:18:19.750
Thanks!

00:18:19.750 --> 00:18:20.800
Thank you!

00:18:20.800 --> 00:18:22.420
Cocoa Santa...

00:18:22.830 --> 00:18:25.880
No, it's me who should 
be thanking all of you.

00:18:26.330 --> 00:18:31.500
For showing me those wonderful smiles.
And also... for protecting my cafe!

00:18:33.080 --> 00:18:34.670
This is my father's cafe....

00:18:36.580 --> 00:18:37.880
Takahiro.

00:18:39.540 --> 00:18:42.580
Do you think Chino's mother 
imagined things like this?

00:18:43.630 --> 00:18:46.880
The unfinished uniforms being completed...

00:18:48.670 --> 00:18:52.500
And two new colors being 
added to the lineup...

00:18:54.540 --> 00:18:58.330
I would say this is a sight beyond
what even she dreamed of.

00:19:05.250 --> 00:19:06.380
Indeed.

00:19:37.960 --> 00:19:40.830
I'm playing the role of 
Surprise Santa this time.

00:19:41.290 --> 00:19:43.960
Now I can return the favor from last year.

00:20:09.330 --> 00:20:10.560
IT'S SANTA TIME!

00:20:10.560 --> 00:20:11.690
What?!

00:20:11.690 --> 00:20:13.020
Chino?

00:20:13.020 --> 00:20:16.250
I swear, this is the only time
you manage to wake up on your own!

00:20:21.750 --> 00:20:24.000
I guess there's two 
Surprise Santas this year.

00:20:24.380 --> 00:20:25.790
Here! Open it up!

00:20:27.500 --> 00:20:29.080
A bunny clock!

00:20:29.920 --> 00:20:31.670
It's got an alarm feature, too.

00:20:32.080 --> 00:20:35.830
Since we're always together,
I figured something practical would be nice.

00:20:36.290 --> 00:20:40.960
Ugh... now my present feels 
ordinary by comparison.

00:20:41.500 --> 00:20:43.580
I just can't win in the surprise department.

00:21:02.960 --> 00:21:03.980
Hi, Cocoa.

00:21:03.980 --> 00:21:07.380
Morning, Rize! Yesterday sure was fun, huh?

00:21:07.830 --> 00:21:08.540
Yeah.

00:21:09.580 --> 00:21:10.620
Where's Chino?

00:21:11.210 --> 00:21:13.460
I took a peek earlier and 
she was still asleep.

00:21:13.460 --> 00:21:16.000
Sleeping in? She never does that.

00:21:17.710 --> 00:21:20.040
Well, she stayed up pretty 
late just for my sake.

00:21:21.260 --> 00:21:23.510
Goooood morning! Wake up!

00:21:23.510 --> 00:21:27.070
Please tell me how to shut this noisy thing up!

00:21:23.510 --> 00:21:27.070
Time to get up and dance with your big sister!

00:21:27.070 --> 00:21:29.130
Wow, you're already putting it to use!

00:21:27.250 --> 00:21:29.790
Goooood morning! Wake up!

00:21:29.130 --> 00:21:30.910
It won't stop!

00:21:29.790 --> 00:21:32.850
Time to get up and dance 
with your big sister!

00:21:30.910 --> 00:21:32.850
Just let it keep going, then.

00:21:33.210 --> 00:21:35.910
Ugh! It's driving me up the walls!

00:21:33.210 --> 00:21:35.910
Goooood morning! Wake up!

00:21:35.910 --> 00:21:38.920
Time to get up and dance 
with your big sister!

00:21:36.600 --> 00:21:40.000
Oh, not like that. To stop the alarm,
you have to push this button here...

00:21:39.630 --> 00:21:42.080
Goooood morning! Wake up!

00:21:40.960 --> 00:21:43.210
Huh? That's weird.

00:21:42.080 --> 00:21:45.290
Time to get up and dance 
with your big sister!

00:21:43.210 --> 00:21:45.000
Do something, Cocoa!

00:21:45.000 --> 00:21:47.000
Stop that racket already, you two!

00:21:45.710 --> 00:21:48.000
Goooood morning! Wake up!

00:21:48.000 --> 00:21:51.830
This level of rowdiness
is also beyond what anyone expected.

00:21:48.460 --> 00:21:51.830
Time to get up and dance 
with your big sister!

00:21:52.210 --> 00:21:52.920
No doubt.

00:21:52.210 --> 00:21:54.580
Goooood morning! Wake up!

00:21:54.580 --> 00:21:55.630
Time to get up and...

00:21:56.330 --> 00:21:58.500
Nakayoshi da zutto da!

00:21:58.500 --> 00:22:00.350
Nakayoshi! Maru! Nakayoshi!

00:22:00.350 --> 00:22:03.800
Kimecchaimasu Maru desukara mondai nai!!

00:22:03.800 --> 00:22:07.710
Kono sekai ni wa fushigi ga aru to

00:22:07.710 --> 00:22:11.490
Minareta mado kara osasoi no message

00:22:11.490 --> 00:22:15.500
Ironna toko e dekakemasen ka?

00:22:15.500 --> 00:22:19.440
Hai hai tama ni wa bouken mo hitsuyou desu ne

00:22:19.440 --> 00:22:22.940
Soshite soshite tooi machikado de kitto

00:22:23.380 --> 00:22:27.210
Itsumo no coffee nomitaku naru hazu

00:22:27.210 --> 00:22:33.330
Hanarete mite wakaru koto ga takusan aru

00:22:35.330 --> 00:22:36.830
Yappari...

00:22:36.830 --> 00:22:40.630
Ima wa issho ga ii ne zutto issho ga ii ne

00:22:40.630 --> 00:22:44.340
Kawatteku kisetsu no naka demo

00:22:44.340 --> 00:22:48.340
Onaji kimochi de itai minna o daiji ni shitai

00:22:48.340 --> 00:22:52.350
Daisuki na basho ga atte yokatta

00:22:52.350 --> 00:22:56.230
Ima wa issho ga ii ne sou da issho ga ii ne

00:22:56.230 --> 00:22:59.920
Dokoka ittemo chanto modotte kite

00:22:59.920 --> 00:23:02.000
Tsutawatteru ki ga shimasu

00:23:02.000 --> 00:23:07.330
Datte datte hora kyou mo minna ni aemashita

00:23:07.750 --> 00:23:13.750
Aitai toki ni aerutte... nakayoshi!

00:23:15.920 --> 00:23:17.790
Nakayoshi da zutto da!

00:23:17.790 --> 00:23:19.250
Nakayoshi! Maru! Nakayoshi!

00:23:19.670 --> 00:23:23.540
Kimecchaimasu Maru desukara mondai nai!!

00:23:26.460 --> 00:23:28.790
The fun times are coming to an end already?

00:23:28.790 --> 00:23:30.880
What am I supposed to do with 
myself after next week?!

00:23:30.880 --> 00:23:33.290
Maybe we can start "Is the Order a Grandpa?"

00:23:32.630 --> 00:23:35.970
Bunnisode 12: I Can Take That Step 
Forward Because You Are Watching

00:23:33.290 --> 00:23:34.880
I'm totally up for that!

00:23:34.880 --> 00:23:35.960
Not happening!
